{"text": "One windy autumn evening in Paris, I was sitting in silence with my friend C, Auguste Dupin in his small library, which was dark. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly the door opened, and in walked Monsieur G, the Prefect of the Paris police, an old acquaintance of ours. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Dupin rose to light a lamp, but he sat down again when the Prefect said he wanted advice about an official matter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If it is a problem that requires thought, said Dupin, we shall examine it better in the dark. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Prefect explained that the case was very simple but very odd, and Dupin replied, Perhaps the mystery is a little too plain. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At this the Prefect roared with laughter, crying that nobody had ever heard of such a foolish idea. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then, having made us promise to keep it secret, he told us that a letter of great importance had been stolen from the royal apartments. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The thief, he said, was the Minister D, a bold, clever man, who was now using the letter to gain power over its owner.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "e", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", "y", " ", "a", "u", "t", "u", "m", "n", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "i", "n", " ", "P", "a", "r", "i", "s", ",", " ", "I", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "s", "i", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "i", "n", " ", "s", "i", "l", "e", "n", "c", "e", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "m", "y", " ", "f", "r", "i", "e", "n", "d", " ", "C", ",", " ", "A", "u", "g", "u", "s", "t", "e", " ", "D", "u", "p", "i", "n", " ", "i", "n", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "l", "i", "b", "r", "a", "r", "y", ",", " ", "w", "h", "i", "c", "h", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "d", "a", "r", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "u", "d", "d", "e", "n", "l", "y", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", " ", "o"